 "Security & Enforceability | Adjudix Dispute Resolution Institute": "/odr/security",
 "Security & Enforceability": "/odr/security",
 "A dispute resolved online is only worth something if the outcome actually holds up. Here's the legal and data-security basis behind every case filed through the ODR Platform.": "/odr/security",
 "Statutory basis": "/odr/security",
 "Arbitration proceedings are governed by the Arbitration and Conciliation Act, {0}; mediation and conciliation by the Mediation Act, {1} and Part III of the {2} Act respectively.": "/odr/security",
 "Arbitral awards are enforceable as a decree of a civil court. Settlement agreements from mediation and conciliation carry equivalent enforceable status once executed.": "/odr/security",
 "Case documents and hearing content are confidential to the parties and the appointed neutral, disclosed only where the parties agree or the law requires it.": "/odr/security",
 "Data handling": "/odr/security",
 "Personal and case data submitted through the ODR Platform is used only for administering your case, consistent with applicable data protection law.": "/odr/security",
 "Questions about how your case is handled?": "/odr/security",
 "Read Our Privacy Policy": "/odr/security",
