 "Privacy Policy | Adjudix Dispute Resolution Institute": "/privacy",
 "Legal": "/privacy",
 "How Adjudix collects, uses, and protects your personal and case data. Effective from the institute's founding; version {0}.": "/privacy",
 "What we collect": "/privacy",
 "Name, contact details, and case-related documents you submit through the ODR Platform or Contact Us form. We do not collect more than is needed to administer your case or query.": "/privacy",
 "How we use it": "/privacy",
 "Solely to administer your case, process your application, or respond to your query — never sold to third parties, and never used for unrelated marketing without your consent.": "/privacy",
 "Confidentiality of case data": "/privacy",
 "Case documents and hearing content are confidential to the parties and the appointed neutral, consistent with the confidentiality principle in our Moral Code of Principles.": "/privacy",
 "Your rights": "/privacy",
 "You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data, subject to our obligation to retain case records as required by law.": "/privacy",
 "Data protection law": "/privacy",
 "Adjudix processes personal data in a manner consistent with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, {0}.": "/privacy",
 "Terms & Conditions | Adjudix Dispute Resolution Institute": "/terms",
 "The terms governing use of this website and Adjudix's dispute resolution services. Effective from the institute's founding; version {0}.": "/terms",
 "Acceptance of terms": "/terms",
 "By using the ODR Platform or engaging Adjudix as an administering institution, you agree to these terms and to the Adjudix Code of ADR Procedure, {0}.": "/terms",
 "Scope of services": "/terms",
 "Adjudix administers arbitration, mediation, conciliation, emergency arbitration, hybrid (Med-Arb) and corporate ADR, and access to Lok Adalat, online and offline; supports the implementation of orders and awards; drafts contracts and dispute resolution clauses; and operates a Training Institute and membership programme, as described throughout this site.": "/terms",
 "Fees": "/terms",
 "Administrative fees are indicative until a case is filed, at which point a final fee is confirmed in writing before proceedings begin.": "/terms",
 "Limitation of liability": "/terms",
 "Adjudix administers proceedings but does not guarantee any particular outcome. Awards and settlement agreements are the product of the appointed neutral's independent judgment or the parties' own agreement.": "/terms",
 "Grievance Redressal": "/terms",
 "If you believe Adjudix, a panelist, or the ODR Platform has fallen short of the standards set out in our Moral Code of Principles or the Adjudix Code of ADR Procedure, submit a grievance through our <1>grievance form</1>, describing the matter in detail. The Secretariat reviews every grievance and responds directly.": "/terms",
 "Training & Certification Institute | Adjudix Dispute Resolution Institute": "/training",
 "A serious credential, not an afterthought": "/training",
 "Six professional and student tracks — ADR Overview, Arbitration, Mediation, Conciliation, Contract Drafting, and Hybrid ADR — each tied to a published Competence Framework — so a certificate actually means something to a client checking it.": "/training",
 "From first course to panel appointment": "/training",
 "Training at Adjudix isn't a standalone certificate mill — it's connected directly to panel eligibility and membership standing. What you learn in a track is what a client is actually trusting when they see your credential. Every track is taught by our <1>faculty</1> of practising arbitrators, mediators, and conciliators.": "/training",
 "Course tracks": "/training",
 "ADR Overview": "/training",
 "The full ADR landscape — every mechanism, when to use it, and how outcomes are implemented.": "/training",
 "Arbitrator Track": "/training",
 "Professional and student tracks toward panel-eligible arbitration practice.": "/training",
 "Conciliator Track": "/training",
 "Training in active, proposal-led settlement facilitation.": "/training",
 "Mediator Track": "/training",
 "Facilitative technique for guiding parties to their own settlement.": "/training",
 "Contract Drafting Track": "/training",
 "Drafting enforceable arbitration and mediation clauses for commercial contracts.": "/training",
 "Hybrid ADR Track": "/training",
 "Running Med-Arb and other hybrid processes from mediation through to a binding award.": "/training",
 "Explore the full picture": "/training",
 "See what each certificate attests to, meet our faculty, or see upcoming courses.": "/training",
 "Certification Framework": "/training",
 "Upcoming Courses": "/training",
